OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 28 Oct to Fri 6 Nov
OL,6,FAfter an unsettled start to the week
OL,7,Fconditions will likely become more
OL,8,Fsettled with rain and stronger winds
OL,9,Fbecoming more confined to northwestern
OL,10,Fareas. Likely turning drier and calmer
OL,11,Facross the south and east bringing a
OL,12,Fgreater chance of chilly nights and
OL,13,Fmorning fog patches. A similar pattern
OL,14,Fthen likely continuing during early
OL,15,FNovember though with a chance that
OL,16,Fsettled conditions may develop more
OL,17,Fwidely for a time. Temperatures
OL,18,Fvarying around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
